			"notes": "## What's New?\n***\n\nThis release fixes an issue where our mixin transformations are ignored on the latest Essential version (1.3.2.6). If you have pinned your Essential version to something lower, this release will crash your game, but you can still use the old version (2.3.0).\n\nIf you run into any issues please open a GitHub issue.\n\n## General\n - feat: Transform our own classes to remove MethodHandles\n - fix: apply MixinExtras at the PREINIT environment\n\n## Commands\n***\n - /simpletogglesprint, /togglesprint - Opens the configuration window\n\n## More info\n***\n - Make sure you have Minecraft Forge for either 1.8.9 or 1.12.2 installed. You can get the universal installer [for 1.8.9 here](https://files.minecraftforge.net/maven/net/minecraftforge/forge/1.8.9-11.15.1.2318-1.8.9/forge-1.8.9-11.15.1.2318-1.8.9-installer.jar) and [for 1.12.2 here]( https://maven.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/1.12.2-14.23.5.2855/forge-1.12.2-14.23.5.2855-installer.jar).\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/My-Name-Is-Jeff/SimpleToggleSprint/compare/v2.3.0...v2.4.0"
